<title>USA: BDM sees Q4 charge due to acquisition.</title>
<headline>BDM sees Q4 charge due to acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>BDM International Inc said Monday it has acquired RGTI Systems Software, for $16.4 million, which will be paid out of BDM's cash balances.</p>
<p>As a result of the acquisition, BDM said it is taking a $10.8 million pre-tax charge ($0.41 per share after-tax) in the fourth quarter relating to the write-off of purchased research and development technology.</p>
<p>BDM said the company expects the acquisition to be additive to earnings in 1997.</p>
</text>
